title: "Twelve conventions for scoring a clear-sky validation, from one matchup set"
abstract: >-
  One MODIS-CALIPSO matchup set scored twelve ways: two truth definitions, two confidence reductions, three poolings, plus the metric axis, the matching-window axis and the branch flag.
